    <!-- Disclosures & Limitations -->
    <string name="disclaimer_title">Enterprise Security Boundaries</string>
    <string name="disclaimer_text">• Browser-level allowlist strictly controls navigation inside SecureBrowse only.\n• On unmanaged personal devices, users may open other installed browsers (e.g. Chrome) unless provisioned as Android Enterprise Device Owner.\n• In Device Owner mode, LockTaskMode locks this app in foreground and disables Home, Recents, and Status Bar.\n• Approved websites may load resources (scripts, images, CDNs). SecureBrowse permits necessary assets while strictly preventing cross-site navigation, iframes to unapproved domains, and popups.\n• A local PIN protects app settings; device-wide tamper resistance requires Android Enterprise management and MDM network filtering.</string>

